sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Drive as External Mac Photos drive
  participant Mac as Mac / Apple Photos
  participant Bridge as ImmiBridge
  participant VPN as Tailscale Serve HTTPS
  participant Server as Immich on Windows
  participant HDD as External NTFS photo disk
  participant DB as Docker-managed PostgreSQL
  Note over Drive,Bridge: Automated schedule NOT YET ENABLED
  Drive->>Mac: Mount and verify correct .photoslibrary
  Mac->>Bridge: Grant Photos access
  Bridge->>Bridge: Smart mode + Dry Run + small pilot
  Bridge-->>VPN: HTTPS API upload (future scheduled backup)
  VPN-->>Server: Private reverse proxy to Immich
  Server->>HDD: Save photo/video files
  Server->>DB: Record metadata and album relations
  Note over Server,DB: Back up the media AND database separately
